    "sourceUrl": "https://www.treasury.gov/auctions/treasury/rp/266moore.shtml",
    "raw": "266 Moore Drive, Kodak, Tennessee 37764 Seized Real Property in conjunction with IRS-CI 266 Moore Drive, Kodak, Tennessee 37764 ONLINE AUCTION Auction Date and Time: Friday, October 2, 2026 from 11am-1pm ET Inspections: Saturday-Sunday, September 26 and 27, 1:00 - 4:00 pm Deposit: $20,000 cashier's check made payable to CWS Marketing Group, Inc Starting Bid: $50,000 Property Photo Gallery: View Here Property Floor Plan: View Here Auction Flyer: Download here Terms of Sale: View here Deposit due no later than October 1 Auction Details/2-Step Registration Book an Appointment Living Space: 5,206 ± sq. ft. Site Area: 6.15 ± acres Year Built: 1987 County: Sevier 2023 County Taxes: $902 ± Parcel No: 005 062.05 000 Utilities: Electric, Water, Septic Zoning: A-1/Agricultural Sale Number: 27-66-801 SINGLE FAMILY HOME WITH ACCESSORY DWELLING Single family home with detached accessory dwelling and 2 storage buildings on 6.15 ± acres of rural land. The 5,206 ± sq. ft. home has 7 bedrooms, 3.1 baths, kitchen, living room with fireplace, dining room, family room, den, laundry, unfinished basement with 1-car garage, and covered porches. Note: Sections of the 2nd floor are unfinished. The 1,176 ± sq. ft. 2-level accessory dwelling has 4 bedrooms, 1 bath, kitchen, living room, and covered entry. Per the stated Terms of Sale, this property is sold AS IS WHERE IS WITH ALL FAULTS including any building violations for the building as a whole that may apply (including but not limited to fines and penalties). Clear Title will be transferred via a Government Deed. ONLINE BIDDING All bidding occurs online at bid.cwsmarketing.com and requires a 2-step registration process. I Contact Us I I How To Guide for Online Bidding I I View other Properties I I Home I",
