    "sourceUrl": "https://www.treasury.gov/auctions/treasury/rp/21370military.shtml",
    "raw": "21370 Military Highway, San Benito, Texas 78586 Seized Real Property in conjunction with HSI 21370 Military Highway, San Benito, Texas 78586 ONLINE AUCTION Auction Date and Time: Friday, September 18, 2026 from 11am-1pm CT (12-2pm ET) Inspections: Saturday, September 5 and 12, 1:00 - 4:00 pm Deposit: $20,000 cashier's check made payable to CWS Marketing Group, Inc Starting Bid: $70,000 Property Photo Gallery: View Here Property Floor Plan: View Here Auction Flyer: Download here Terms of Sale: View here Deposit due no later than September 17 Auction Details/2-Step Registration Book an Appointment Improved Area: 1,845 ± sq. ft. Site Area: 1.61 ± acres Year Built: 2016 County: Cameron 2025 County Taxes: $3,752.45 ± Parcel No: 186461 Utilities: Electric, Water Zoning: None Sale Number: 26-66-167 COMMERCIAL BUILDING Commercial building on Cameron County Appraisal District Parcel ID #186461, located approximately 9 miles southwest of downtown San Benito along Military Highway (US Hwy 281). Situated on approximately 1.6 ± acres, the building's exterior is stone and stucco. Interior features tile flooring, a private office with private bath with shower, open office area, break room, 2nd restroom, and an attached garage. The property is fully fenced with a gated entrance, and the site is primarily blacktopped, providing parking and vehicle access. Note: Utilities will not be turned on for inspections or at any time prior to closing. Per the stated Terms of Sale, this property is sold AS IS WHERE IS WITH ALL FAULTS including any building violations for the building as a whole that may apply (including but not limited to fines and penalties). Clear Title will be transferred via a Government Deed. ONLINE BIDDING All bidding occurs online at bid.cwsmarketing.com and requires a 2-step registration process. I Contact Us I I How To Guide for Online Bidding I I View other Properties I I Home I",
