    "sourceUrl": "https://www.treasury.gov/auctions/treasury/rp/1593topnotch.shtml",
    "raw": "1593 Top Notch Trail, Penrose, Colorado 81240 Seized Real Property in conjunction with IRS-CI 1593 Top Notch Trail, Penrose, Colorado 81240 ONLINE AUCTION Auction Date and Time: Friday, September 25, 2026 from 11am-1pm MDT (1-3pm ET) Inspections: Saturday-Sunday, September 19 and 20, 10:00 am - 2:00 pm Deposit: $25,000 cashier's check made payable to CWS Marketing Group, Inc Starting Bid: $180,000 Property Photo Gallery: View Here Property Floor Plan: View Here Auction Flyer: Download here Terms of Sale: View here Deposit due no later than September 24 Auction Details/2-Step Registration Book an Appointment Living Space: 3,113 ± sq. ft. Site Area: 2.9 ± acres Year Built: 2008 County: Fremont 2025 County Taxes: $4,101 ± Parcel No: 000099927508 Utilities: Electric, Gas, Water, Septic Zoning: R1/Residential Sale Number: 26-66-877 SINGLE FAMILY HOME 3,113 ± sq. ft. home with 2 bedrooms, 2.1 baths, kitchen, living room with fireplace, dining room, den, wine storage, utility room, deck, and attached 3-car garage. The 3,113 ± sq. ft. walk-out basement includes an additional 2 bedrooms, full bath, den, family room with wet bar, media room, and covered patio. The home sits on 2.9 ± acres with a detached 3-car garage and 2 storage sheds in Top Rail Ranch Estates. Note: The 2.64 ± acre lot at 48 Tumbleweed Trail, located across the street from the home, is also being auctioned separately on the same day. Per the stated Terms of Sale, this property is sold AS IS WHERE IS WITH ALL FAULTS including any building violations for the building as a whole that may apply (including but not limited to fines and penalties). Clear Title will be transferred via a Government Deed. ONLINE BIDDING All bidding occurs online at bid.cwsmarketing.com and requires a 2-step registration process. I Contact Us I I How To Guide for Online Bidding I I View other Properties I I Home I",
